  - nodeId: cn_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Sobota rano. Kuba idzie do pracy wzd\u0142u\u017C Liffey. Nad miastem tyle d\u017Awig\xF3w, \u017Ce kto\u015B w radiu \u017Cartowa\u0142, \u017Ce to narodowy ptak Irlandii."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch3_tunde_friend
    branchNodeId: cn_tunde
    nextNodeId: cn_alone
  - nodeId: cn_tunde
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Tunde idzie obok. Dwa lata temu st\u0142uk\u0142 stos talerzy na brunchu. Dzi\u015B studiuje wieczorowo ksi\u0119gowo\u015B\u0107 i pisze do Lagos maile o irlandzkich podatkach."
    - speakerId: tunde
      language: 1
      text: 'My uncle says Nigeria will be rich one day, like here. I tell him: here was poor too. Fifty years ago they were all on the boats.'
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Tunde ma racj\u0119. Ka\u017Cdy kiedy\u015B od tego zaczyna\u0142. Irlandczycy te\u017C."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - uncle
    - rich
    - poor
    - boats
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cn_evening
  - nodeId: cn_alone
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Licz\u0119 d\u017Awigi do dwudziestu i przestaj\u0119. Dwa lata temu my\u0142em talerze ludziom, kt\xF3rzy budowali to miasto. Dzi\u015B myj\u0119 talerze ludziom, kt\xF3rzy je sprzedaj\u0105."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cn_evening
  - nodeId: cn_evening
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Wieczorem, po zamkni\u0119ciu. Declan nalewa dwie whiskey i jedn\u0105 przesuwa po stali do Kuby."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Enjoy it, Kooba. All of it. My father used to say nothing in this country ever lasts, except the rain and the begrudgers.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - enjoy
    - lasts
    - except
    - rain
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_begrudgers
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch4_booked_flat
    branchNodeId: cn_flat
    nextNodeId: cn_last
  - nodeId: cn_flat
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "W portfelu potwierdzenie rezerwacji z Navan. Pi\u0119\u0107dziesi\u0105t euro w murach, kt\xF3rych jeszcze nie ma. Declan m\xF3wi \"nic nie trwa\", a ja my\u015Bl\u0119 o kredycie na trzydzie\u015Bci lat."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: cn_last
  - nodeId: cn_last
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Wypijam. Pali jak \u017Bubr\xF3wka Tomka. Za oknem d\u017Awig obraca si\u0119 powoli, jakby sprawdza\u0142, czy wszyscy s\u0105 jeszcze na miejscu."
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Koniec Rozdzia\u0142u 4: Celtycki Tygrys."
